# The 3D glyph text gate's rows (tests/harness/check_text_font.sh; fields and cache
# modes are documented there). The font model (class 265) is resident only in
# the home worlds.
#
# name            | level          | cache                    | expect
cold-non-home     | cloud_spires   | cold                     | none
home-world        | sunrise_spring | fresh                    | ram
warm-non-home     | cloud_spires   | warm:home-world          | file
reject-checksum   | cloud_spires   | bad-checksum:home-world  | none
reject-disc       | cloud_spires   | bad-disc:home-world      | none
reject-version    | cloud_spires   | bad-version:home-world   | none
